        "original_id": "439dba6e-9e87-58e6-8e3f-6b9cb7316ea4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Owen Wister, Lucy Maud Montgomery, L.M. Montgomery\n- Roles: writer, historian, author\n- Works: western fiction, Anne of Green Gables\n\nFacts:\n- Owen Wister was born on July 14, 1860, and he was an American writer, historian, and the \"father\" of western fiction.\n- Lucy Maud Montgomery was born on November 30, 1874, and she published under the name L.M. Montgomery.\n- In 1908, Lucy Maud Montgomery began the novel series for which she is best known with Anne of Green Gables.\n- Owen Wister died on July 21, 1938.\n- Lucy Maud Montgomery died on April 24, 1942, and she was a Canadian author.",
